{"seq":2,"slug":"polymorphism-type-inference","title":"多态与类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/polymorphism-type-inference","wordCount":1595,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"多态与类型推断\">多态与类型推断</h1><p>OCaml 的类型推断引擎基于 Algorithm W（Hindley-Milner 类型系统的实例化），能在绝大多数情况下自动推导出表达式的最一般类型（principal type），无需程序员手动标注。这套机制在保持类型安全的前提下极大降低了代码的注解负担，同时通过参数多态实现高度的代码复用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OCaml 的类型系统能在不要求大量注解的前提下保持类型安全，靠的是下面几条互相配合的机制。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心命题</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>直接后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hindley-Milner</td>\n<td>用合一求解类型方程，推出最一般类型（principal type）</td>\n<td>绝大多数函数无需手写类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛化与实例化</td>\n<td><code>let</code> 绑定处把自由类型变量泛化为多态</td>\n<td>同一个 <code>id</code> 可分别用于 <code>int</code> 与 <code>string</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值限制</td>\n<td>只有语法上是值的表达式才被泛化</td>\n<td>可变引用不会获得不安全的自由多态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行多态</td>\n<td>类型中含「可能还有其它字段」的行变量</td>\n<td>结构子类型与可扩展的多态变体得以成立</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：推断负责「少写类型」，值限制与行多态负责「少写但不牺牲安全」。下面几节依次展开合一算法、值限制与弱多态、参数多态与特设多态的区别，以及行多态与高阶多态这些边界话题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hindley-milner-类型推断\">Hindley-Milner 类型推断</h2><p>Algorithm W 通过合一（unification）求解类型方程来推断类型。其核心思想可以用一个简单例子说明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let compose f g x = f (g x)&#10;(* 推断类型: (&#39;b -&gt; &#39;c) -&gt; (&#39;a -&gt; &#39;b) -&gt; &#39;a -&gt; &#39;c *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let compose f g x = f (g x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 推断类型: ('b -> 'c) -> ('a -> 'b) -> 'a -> 'c *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>推断过程中，编译器为每个子表达式分配类型变量，然后根据应用规则建立约束方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi>e</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\Gamma \\vdash f : \\tau_1 \\to \\tau_2 \\quad \\Gamma \\vdash e : \\tau_1}{\\Gamma \\vdash f\\;e : \\tau_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于 <code>compose</code> 函数，约束求解过程产生的方程组为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f : \\alpha \\to \\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g : \\gamma \\to \\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>（因为 <code>g x</code> 的结果作为 <code>f</code> 的参数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x : \\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><code>compose</code> 整体：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\alpha \\to \\beta) \\to (\\gamma \\to \\alpha) \\to \\gamma \\to \\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>OCaml 的实现采用 level-based 泛化策略——每个 <code>let</code> 绑定引入一个新层级，只有在当前层级内引入且未被外层约束捕获的类型变量才会被泛化为多态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let id x = x          (* val id : &#39;a -&gt; &#39;a — &#39;a 被泛化 *)&#10;let n = id 42         (* val n : int — 实例化 &#39;a = int *)&#10;let s = id &quot;hello&quot;    (* val s : string — 实例化 &#39;a = string *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let id x = x          (* val id : 'a -> 'a — 'a 被泛化 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let n = id 42         (* val n : int — 实例化 'a = int *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let s = id \"hello\"    (* val s : string — 实例化 'a = string *)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"值限制与弱多态\">值限制与弱多态</h2><p>ML 类型系统的一个经典陷阱是值限制（value restriction）。在存在可变引用的语言中，无限制的多态会导致类型不安全：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let r = ref []&#10;(* 如果推断为 &#39;a list ref，则：*)&#10;(* r := [1]; List.hd !r |&gt; string_of_int 类型安全但语义错误 *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let r = ref []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 如果推断为 'a list ref，则：*)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* r := [1]; List.hd !r |> string_of_int 类型安全但语义错误 *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OCaml 通过值限制解决这个问题：只有语法上是值（syntactic value）的表达式才会被泛化。非值表达式中的自由类型变量保持为弱多态类型变量 <code>&#39;_weak</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let r = ref []&#10;(* val r : &#39;_weak1 list ref *)&#10;(* 第一次使用时确定具体类型 *)&#10;let () = r := [1]&#10;(* 此后 r : int list ref *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let r = ref []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* val r : '_weak1 list ref *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 第一次使用时确定具体类型 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let () = r := [1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 此后 r : int list ref *)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表达式形式</th>\n<th>是否为语法值</th>\n<th>泛化行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>常量、变量</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>完全泛化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fun x -&gt; ...</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>完全泛化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>let ... in ...</code>（body 是值）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>完全泛化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构造器应用到值</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>完全泛化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数应用 <code>f x</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>弱多态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ref e</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>弱多态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>if ... then ... else ...</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>弱多态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>relaxed value restriction（OCaml 特有）进一步放宽了限制：如果表达式的类型仅在协变（covariant）位置包含类型变量，即使不是语法值也可以泛化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let empty_list = List.map (fun x -&gt; x) []&#10;(* val empty_list : &#39;a list — 因为 list 是协变的 *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let empty_list = List.map (fun x -> x) []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* val empty_list : 'a list — 因为 list 是协变的 *)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"参数多态与特设多态\">参数多态与特设多态</h2><p>OCaml 的核心多态是参数多态（parametric polymorphism）——对类型参数不做任何假设，所有类型统一处理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let length lst =&#10;  let rec aux acc = function&#10;    | [] -&gt; acc&#10;    | _ :: tl -&gt; aux (acc + 1) tl&#10;  in&#10;  aux 0 lst&#10;(* val length : &#39;a list -&gt; int *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let length lst =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let rec aux acc = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | [] -> acc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | _ :: tl -> aux (acc + 1) tl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  aux 0 lst</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* val length : 'a list -> int *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与 Haskell 的 typeclass 或 Rust 的 trait 不同，OCaml 不在核心语言层面提供 ad-hoc 多态。相当的功能通过模块系统实现——详见 <a href=\"../module-system/modules-signatures-functors\">模块、签名与函子</a>。但 OCaml 也提供一些有限的重载机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* 运算符重载通过模块 local open 实现 *)&#10;let complex_add =&#10;  let open Complex in&#10;  { re = 1.0; im = 2.0 } |&gt; add { re = 3.0; im = 4.0 }&#10;&#10;(* OCaml 5.5: 模块依赖函数提供轻量级的类型类效果 *)&#10;let pp_map (module M : Map.S) pp_key pp_v ppf set =&#10;  if M.is_empty set then Format.fprintf ppf &quot;empty&quot;&#10;  else M.iter (fun k v -&gt; Format.fprintf ppf &quot;%a=%a &quot; pp_key k pp_v v) set\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* 运算符重载通过模块 local open 实现 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let complex_add =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let open Complex in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  { re = 1.0; im = 2.0 } |> add { re = 3.0; im = 4.0 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* OCaml 5.5: 模块依赖函数提供轻量级的类型类效果 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let pp_map (module M : Map.S) pp_key pp_v ppf set =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if M.is_empty set then Format.fprintf ppf \"empty\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else M.iter (fun k v -> Format.fprintf ppf \"%a=%a \" pp_key k pp_v v) set</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"类型注解与约束\">类型注解与约束</h2><p>虽然 OCaml 能推断大多数类型，但在某些场景下显式注解是必要的或有益的：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* 1. 约束多态以获得更好的错误信息 *)&#10;let safe_head (lst : &#39;a list) : &#39;a option =&#10;  match lst with&#10;  | [] -&gt; None&#10;  | x :: _ -&gt; Some x&#10;&#10;(* 2. 局部抽象类型——GADT 匹配中必须 *)&#10;let rec eval : type a. a expr -&gt; a = function&#10;  | Int n -&gt; n&#10;  | Bool b -&gt; b&#10;  | Add (e1, e2) -&gt; eval e1 + eval e2&#10;&#10;(* 3. 强制类型缩窄 *)&#10;let process (x : int) = x * 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* 1. 约束多态以获得更好的错误信息 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let safe_head (lst : 'a list) : 'a option =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match lst with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | [] -> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | x :: _ -> Some x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 2. 局部抽象类型——GADT 匹配中必须 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let rec eval : type a. a expr -> a = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Int n -> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Bool b -> b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Add (e1, e2) -> eval e1 + eval e2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 3. 强制类型缩窄 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let process (x : int) = x * 2</span></span></code></pre></div><p>类型注解在 OCaml 中是约束而非声明——它们不会改变推断的类型，只是添加编译器必须验证的额外条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行多态与对象类型\">行多态与对象类型</h2><p>OCaml 的对象系统使用行多态（row polymorphism）实现结构子类型。行变量 <code>..</code> 表示「可能还有其他方法」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let get_name obj = obj#name&#10;(* val get_name : &lt; name : &#39;a; .. &gt; -&gt; &#39;a *)&#10;(* 接受任何具有 name 方法的对象 *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let get_name obj = obj#name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* val get_name : &#x3C; name : 'a; .. > -> 'a *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 接受任何具有 name 方法的对象 *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>行多态也是多态变体类型系统的基础——<code>[&gt; ...]</code> 和 <code>[&lt; ...]</code> 本质上是行类型的语法糖。这使得多态变体可以在不破坏现有代码的情况下扩展：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type base_event = [ `Click | `Scroll ]&#10;type extended_event = [ base_event | `Keyboard of char ]&#10;&#10;let log_event : [&gt; base_event ] -&gt; unit = function&#10;  | `Click -&gt; print_endline &quot;click&quot;&#10;  | `Scroll -&gt; print_endline &quot;scroll&quot;&#10;  | _ -&gt; print_endline &quot;other&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type base_event = [ `Click | `Scroll ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type extended_event = [ base_event | `Keyboard of char ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let log_event : [> base_event ] -> unit = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | `Click -> print_endline \"click\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | `Scroll -> print_endline \"scroll\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | _ -> print_endline \"other\"</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 参数多态&#10;        A[&#39;a -&gt; &#39;a] --&gt; B[int -&gt; int]&#10;        A --&gt; C[string -&gt; string]&#10;        A --&gt; D[float -&gt; float]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 行多态&#10;        E[&quot;&lt; name: string; .. &gt;&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;&lt; name: string; age: int &gt;&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; G[&quot;&lt; name: string; email: string &gt;&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 多态变体&#10;        H[[&gt; `A | `B ]&quot;] --&gt; I[[ `A | `B | `C ]&quot;]&#10;        H --&gt; J[[ `A | `B | `D ]&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 参数多态\n        A['a -&gt; 'a] --&gt; B[int -&gt; int]\n        A --&gt; C[string -&gt; string]\n        A --&gt; D[float -&gt; float]\n    end\n    subgraph 行多态\n        E[\"&lt; name: string; .. &gt;\"] --&gt; F[\"&lt; name: string; age: int &gt;\"]\n        E --&gt; G[\"&lt; name: string; email: string &gt;\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 多态变体\n        H[[&gt; `A | `B ]\"] --&gt; I[[ `A | `B | `C ]\"]\n        H --&gt; J[[ `A | `B | `D ]\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"高阶多态与-rank-n-类型\">高阶多态与 Rank-N 类型</h2><p>标准 Hindley-Milner 只支持 rank-1 多态——类型变量只在最外层量化。OCaml 5.5 引入了直接在函数参数中标注多态类型的能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* Rank-2 多态：参数本身是多态函数 *)&#10;let apply_map (map : &#39;a &#39;b. (&#39;a -&gt; &#39;b) -&gt; &#39;a list -&gt; &#39;b list) =&#10;  map string_of_int [1; 2; 3], map List.singleton [&quot;x&quot;; &quot;y&quot;]&#10;&#10;let result = apply_map List.map&#10;(* val result : string list * string list list *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* Rank-2 多态：参数本身是多态函数 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let apply_map (map : 'a 'b. ('a -> 'b) -> 'a list -> 'b list) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  map string_of_int [1; 2; 3], map List.singleton [\"x\"; \"y\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let result = apply_map List.map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* val result : string list * string list list *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在此之前，实现高阶多态需要借助记录或对象的多态字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* OCaml 5.4 及之前的写法 *)&#10;type mapper = { map : &#39;a &#39;b. (&#39;a -&gt; &#39;b) -&gt; &#39;a list -&gt; &#39;b list }&#10;let apply_map { map } =&#10;  map string_of_int [1; 2; 3], map List.singleton [&quot;x&quot;; &quot;y&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* OCaml 5.4 及之前的写法 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type mapper = { map : 'a 'b. ('a -> 'b) -> 'a list -> 'b list }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let apply_map { map } =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  map string_of_int [1; 2; 3], map List.singleton [\"x\"; \"y\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OCaml 5.5 的改进消除了这种间接性，使得高阶多态的表达更加自然。这在需要将泛型操作作为参数传递的场景（如测试框架、序列化库）中尤其有用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"类型推断的边界与实践建议\">类型推断的边界与实践建议</h2><p>类型推断并非万能——理解其边界对于编写可维护的 OCaml 代码至关重要：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推断能力</th>\n<th>建议做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单函数组合</td>\n<td>完全自动</td>\n<td>无需注解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记录字段访问</td>\n<td>需消歧义</td>\n<td>在参数上注解或使用限定路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GADT 匹配</td>\n<td>需局部抽象类型</td>\n<td>必须写 <code>type a.</code> 注解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块签名</td>\n<td>不推断（.mli 需手写）</td>\n<td>始终提供 .mli 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一等模块解包</td>\n<td>需类型注解</td>\n<td>标注期望的模块类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归类型</td>\n<td>需 <code>-rectypes</code> 或显式声明</td>\n<td>优先用显式递归类型声明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>推断与安全可以兼得</strong>：Algorithm W 通过合一求解类型方程，绝大多数函数无需手写类型即可获得最一般类型。</li>\n<li><strong>值限制是安全的必要代价</strong>：只有语法上是值的表达式才被泛化，非值表达式保持 <code>&#39;_weak</code> 弱多态，从而避免可变引用带来的类型不安全。</li>\n<li><strong>relaxed value restriction</strong> 进一步放宽了限制——类型仅在协变位置包含类型变量时，非语法值也可泛化（如 <code>&#39;a list</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>核心多态是参数多态</strong>：ad-hoc 多态不在一等语言层面，而通过模块系统与函子实现；行多态则支撑结构子类型与多态变体。</li>\n<li><strong>推断有明确边界</strong>：GADT 匹配需 <code>type a.</code>、<code>.mli</code> 需手写、一等模块解包需注解——公开 API 始终提供签名文件是最稳的实践。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解这些边界，才能在「依赖推断减少噪声」与「必要时显式注解以帮助编译器」之间做出正确取舍。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多态与类型推断","id":"多态与类型推断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Hindley-Milner 类型推断","id":"hindley-milner-类型推断"},{"level":2,"text":"值限制与弱多态","id":"值限制与弱多态"},{"level":2,"text":"参数多态与特设多态","id":"参数多态与特设多态"},{"level":2,"text":"类型注解与约束","id":"类型注解与约束"},{"level":2,"text":"行多态与对象类型","id":"行多态与对象类型"},{"level":2,"text":"高阶多态与 Rank-N 类型","id":"高阶多态与-rank-n-类型"},{"level":2,"text":"类型推断的边界与实践建议","id":"类型推断的边界与实践建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代数类型与模式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/algebraic-types-pattern-matching"},"next":{"title":"GADT 与幻影类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/type-system/gadt-phantom-types"}}